  m_Name: Object_61
  m_EditorClassIdentifier: 
  partName: Oil Pan Gasket
  description: The Oil Pan Gasket is a tiny, thin-flat gasket located at the bottom-center-center
    of the engine, sealing the oil pan to prevent oil leaks and maintain engine lubrication.
    Its small size and thin shape enable it to fit precisely between the oil pan
    and the engine block, ensuring a reliable seal. Interestingly, the gasket's material,
    Material.003, provides excellent resistance to oil and fuel, making it an ideal
    choice for this application.
  audioExplanation: {fileID: 0}
